WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:23.068
"Kip?" Bird called the next morning.

2
00:00:23.069 --> 00:00:31.945
"Are you up yet?"

3
00:00:31.946 --> 00:00:34.877
She looked in Kip's hole.

4
00:00:34.878 --> 00:00:36.852
Kip wasn't there.

5
00:00:36.853 --> 00:00:41.636
"Kip must be at the race," said Bird.

6
00:00:41.637 --> 00:00:44.737
Bird flew to the starting line.

7
00:00:44.738 --> 00:00:46.647
There was a big crowd.

8
00:00:46.648 --> 00:00:49.585
The runners had numbers on their shirts.

9
00:00:49.586 --> 00:00:51.917
Suddenly the race began.

10
00:00:51.918 --> 00:00:55.376
Everyone started to run.

11
00:00:55.377 --> 00:00:58.989
Bird watched the runners go past.

12
00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:03.339
She didn't see Kip anywhere.

13
00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:05.363
Bird scratched her head.

14
00:01:05.364 --> 00:01:11.998
"I wonder where Kip is," she said.

15
00:01:11.999 --> 00:01:16.493
She saw Squirrel.

16
00:01:16.494 --> 00:01:19.854
"Do you know where Kip is?" asked Bird.

17
00:01:19.855 --> 00:01:22.144
"Yes," said Squirrel.

18
00:01:22.145 --> 00:01:24.588
"I saw him going to the beach."

19
00:01:24.589 --> 00:01:27.902
"The beach?" said Bird.

20
00:01:27.903 --> 00:01:38.424
Bird flew to the beach.

21
00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:41.822
And then she saw Kip!

22
00:01:41.823 --> 00:01:47.285
He was lying in the sand.

23
00:01:47.286 --> 00:01:52.192
"Why aren't you in the race?" asked Bird.

24
00:01:52.193 --> 00:01:56.419
"I can't run in the race," said Kip.

25
00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:04.282
"I'm too tired from training!"
